    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1xray_1_1_log_builder" kindref="compound">LogBuilder</ref> class allows for creating ad-hoc collections of records through the <computeroutput>add&lt;...&gt;(...)</computeroutput> function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An example use of this API is in crafting arbitrary sequences of records:</para>
<para>auto Records = LogBuilder() .add&lt;BufferExtents&gt;(256) .add&lt;NewBufferRecord&gt;(1) .<ref refid="classllvm_1_1xray_1_1_log_builder_1adcf06d87b303da07afe475141075aecb" kindref="member">consume()</ref>; </para>
    </detaileddescription>
